9 0 obj
<< /Length 2020 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738 Td (If the folder already exists:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 717 Td (cd LDC) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 703 Td (git pull) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 670 Td (Create The Settings File) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 645 Td (Run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 624 Td (cp .env.example .env) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 596 Td (Then open .env in a text editor. Your helper should tell you what values to use.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 575 Td (The most important line is DATABASE_URL. It usually looks like this:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 554 Td (DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://ldc:ldc_dev_password@localhost:5432/ldc) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 526 Td (If your helper gave you a different database host, port, username, or password,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 512 Td (  use what they gave you.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 486 Td (Start The App) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 461 Td (Run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 440 Td (./scripts/setup.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 412 Td (This can take several minutes. It installs tools, prepares the database, builds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 398 Td (  the website, and starts the services.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 377 Td (When it is done, open:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 356 Td (http://localhost:3000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 328 Td (If the page asks for a password, use the organizer password your helper gave you.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 302 Td (Open The Database Viewer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 277 Td (Run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 256 Td (./scripts/setup-db-viewer.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 228 Td (Then open:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 207 Td (http://localhost:5050) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 179 Td (Use this login unless your helper gave you a different one:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 158 Td (Email: admin@ldc.local) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 144 Td (Password: ldc_pgadmin_change_me) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 116 Td (Important: if this is more than a private local test, ask your helper to set a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 102 Td (  stronger pgAdmin password.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 81 Td (Inside pgAdmin:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 60 Td (1. Look at the left sidebar.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
8 0 obj
<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 612 792] /Resources << /Font << /F1 3 0 R /F2 4 0 R /F3 5 0 R >> >> /Contents 9 0 R >>
