11 0 obj
<< /Length 2391 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738 Td (2. Expand Servers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 724 Td (3. Click LDC PostgreSQL.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 710 Td (4. If it asks for a password, use the database password from .env.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 696 Td (5. Expand Databases.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 682 Td (6. Expand ldc.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (7. Expand Schemas.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 654 Td (8. Expand public.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 640 Td (9. Expand Tables.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619 Td (The most useful tables are:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 598 Td (- program_sessions: chapter sessions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 584 Td (- participants: participant records.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 570 Td (- session_registrations: who registered for which session.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 556 Td (- match_drafts: draft matches.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 542 Td (- date_history: previous date history.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (To view a table:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 500 Td (1. Right-click the table.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 486 Td (2. Choose View/Edit Data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 472 Td (3. Choose All Rows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (Do not edit database rows directly unless your helper tells you to. Viewing is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 437 Td (  safer than editing.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 411 Td (Remove Demo Data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 386 Td (First run a preview:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 365 Td (./scripts/clear-dummy-data.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 337 Td (Read the numbers it prints. This command does not delete anything.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 316 Td (If the preview looks right, run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 295 Td (./scripts/clear-dummy-data.sh --yes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 267 Td (This removes the sample people and synthetic test data that are only meant for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 253 Td (  demos.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 232 Td (If you want to keep the sample session names but remove sample people, run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 211 Td (./scripts/clear-dummy-data.sh --keep-generated-sessions --yes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 183 Td (If you are unsure, stop and ask your helper before using --yes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 157 Td (Create Your Chapter Session) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 132 Td (Choose:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 111 Td (- A session name.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 97 Td (- A start date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 83 Td (- A location label.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 69 Td (- Whether registration should be open now.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
