13 0 obj
<< /Length 2440 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738 Td (Example:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 717 Td (./scripts/create-session.sh \\) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 703 Td (  --name "Fall 2026 - Your Chapter" \\) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 689 Td (  --starts-on 2026-09-12 \\) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 675 Td (  --location "Your Parish Hall" \\) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 661 Td (  --registration-open \\) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 647 Td (  --attach-default-intake) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 619 Td (Replace:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 598 Td (- Fall 2026 - Your Chapter with your real session name.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 584 Td (- 2026-09-12 with your real date.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 570 Td (- Your Parish Hall with your real location.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 549 Td (If registration is not open yet, remove the --registration-open line.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (To confirm the session exists, open pgAdmin and look in the program_sessions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 514 Td (  table.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 488 Td (Everyday Startup) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 463 Td (If everything is already installed and you just need to start working, run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 442 Td (./scripts/dev.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 414 Td (Then open:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 393 Td (http://localhost:3000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 365 Td (If your helper set up system services instead, they may give you a different) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 351 Td (  startup command.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 325 Td (Make A Backup Before Big Changes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 300 Td (Before deleting data, importing real participants, or changing session setup, make) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 286 Td (  a backup:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 265 Td (pg_dump "postgresql://ldc:ldc_dev_password@localhost:5432/ldc" \\) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 251 Td (  --format=custom \\) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 237 Td (  --file "ldc-backup-$\(date +%Y%m%d%H%M%S\).dump") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 209 Td (If your .env uses a different database password or port, ask your helper for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 195 Td (  exact backup command.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 174 Td (Keep backups somewhere private. They may contain sensitive participant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 160 Td (  information.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 134 Td (What To Send Your Helper If Something Breaks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 109 Td (Send these four things:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 88 Td (1. What you were trying to do.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 74 Td (2. The command you ran.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 60 Td (3. The full error message.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
