15 0 obj
<< /Length 2523 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738 Td (4. A screenshot if the problem happened in the browser.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 717 Td (Do not send the .env file or database password in a group chat.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 691 Td (Common Problems) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 666 Td (Problem: permission denied) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 645 Td (Try:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 624 Td (chmod +x scripts/*.sh) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 596 Td (Then run the command again.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 575 Td (Problem: database does not exist or connection refused) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (The database is not running or .env points to the wrong place. Send the error to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 540 Td (  your helper.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 519 Td (Problem: pgAdmin opens but cannot connect to LDC PostgreSQL) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 498 Td (Run:) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 477 Td (./scripts/setup-db-viewer.sh --replace) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 449 Td (If it still fails, send your helper the error from pgAdmin.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 428 Td (Problem: The app still shows old fake people after clearing dummy data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 407 Td (Try signing out and back in. If that does not work, clear the browser storage for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 393 Td (  localhost:3000 and reload the page.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 372 Td (Problem: You typed the wrong session name or date) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 351 Td (Run create-session.sh again with the same session name and corrected details. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 337 Td (  script updates an existing session when the name matches.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 311 Td (Safe Rules) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 286 Td (- Do not delete real participant data without a backup.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 272 Td (- Do not share .env.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 258 Td (- Do not edit pgAdmin rows directly unless asked.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 244 Td (- Do not reuse demo sessions for a real chapter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 230 Td (- When in doubt, stop and ask.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 204 Td (Quick Command List) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 179 Td (git pull) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 165 Td (cp .env.example .env) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 151 Td (./scripts/setup.sh) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 137 Td (./scripts/setup-db-viewer.sh) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 123 Td (./scripts/clear-dummy-data.sh) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 109 Td (./scripts/clear-dummy-data.sh --yes) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 95 Td (./scripts/create-session.sh --name "Fall 2026 - Chapter Name" --starts-on 2026-09-12) Tj ET
BT /F3 9 Tf 54 81 Td (--location "Parish Hall" --registration-open --attach-default-intake) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
